          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "negahdâri kardan pairs negahdâri, \"keeping\", with kardan. negahdâri is negah, \"look, watch\", with dâr, \"holding\" (from dâshtan), and -i: keeping watch. All the pieces are native. kardan, \"to do\", is an inherited verb, from Middle Persian kardan (EtymDB)."
